    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About This Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mechanic VS AI is a 2D top-down tower defense game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Influenced by classic tower defense and flash games,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > it is filled with unique worlds, figure of enemies and exciting music!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play as a very intelligent mechanic!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maybe You will move forward with a great mission...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And get 30 different turrets from the stages of 5 worlds!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many gimmicks and enemies are also waiting for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finally, get rid of the bosses who are looking for a chance to attack you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(Uh... Additionally, stage scores are meaningless.....)</i></p>",
